      "with": ["ingredient/chicken", "ingredient/water", "ingredient/salt"],
      "text": "Put the {chicken} in a deep pot, breast up, and cover it with the cold {water}. Add the {salt}. Bring it slowly to a tremble and skim off the foam as it rises.",
